    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chilling world of <i>Obscura Protocol</i>, a psychological horror game where observation is your only defense. Hired by the mysterious company Obscura, your task is simple: Monitor various locations through live camera feeds and report anomalies before they spiral out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But nothing is ever truly simple. Each location hides its own horrors, whether it's a sleek modern mansion, a desolate mining site, or the eerie remnants of Forsaken City. Flickering lights, distorted figures, objects shifting without reason, every report matters, and missing a single anomaly could be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Vision Modes:</strong> Switch between <strong>Night Vision, Thermal Vision,</strong> and Standard View to spot disturbances that would otherwise go unnoticed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/c86833f2de15632321455be58d302687.poster.avif?t=1747824839\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/c86833f2de15632321455be58d302687.webm?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/c86833f2de15632321455be58d302687.mp4?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Locations:</strong> Monitor unsettling environments, each with their own secrets and threats.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/b41b1a8c0ce8ce0121739a708850ece3.poster.avif?t=1747824839\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/b41b1a8c0ce8ce0121739a708850ece3.webm?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/b41b1a8c0ce8ce0121739a708850ece3.mp4?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> The creeping dread of being watched and the unease of witnessing the inexplicable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/ba131a319a870d39bdd5e27981dff151.poster.avif?t=1747824839\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/ba131a319a870d39bdd5e27981dff151.webm?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/ba131a319a870d39bdd5e27981dff151.mp4?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Reporting:</strong> Identify, target, and report anomalies before they overwhelm you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/14417d5c69d5f566e314f192f2daa2c5.poster.avif?t=1747824839\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/14417d5c69d5f566e314f192f2daa2c5.webm?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/14417d5c69d5f566e314f192f2daa2c5.mp4?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Until Dawn:</strong> Your shift ends at 6 a.m. if you make it that long.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/ad450579036f3ded72e9e876e876906d.poster.avif?t=1747824839\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/ad450579036f3ded72e9e876e876906d.webm?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/ad450579036f3ded72e9e876e876906d.mp4?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to confront what lurks in the shadows? Or will you be another <strong>[REDACTED]</strong> entry in Obscura\u2019s archives?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chilling world of <i>Obscura Protocol</i>, a psychological horror game where observation is your only defense. Hired by the mysterious company Obscura, your task is simple: Monitor various locations through live camera feeds and report anomalies before they spiral out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But nothing is ever truly simple. Each location hides its own horrors, whether it's a sleek modern mansion, a desolate mining site, or the eerie remnants of Forsaken City. Flickering lights, distorted figures, objects shifting without reason, every report matters, and missing a single anomaly could be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Vision Modes:</strong> Switch between <strong>Night Vision, Thermal Vision,</strong> and Standard View to spot disturbances that would otherwise go unnoticed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/c86833f2de15632321455be58d302687.poster.avif?t=1747824839\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/c86833f2de15632321455be58d302687.webm?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/c86833f2de15632321455be58d302687.mp4?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Locations:</strong> Monitor unsettling environments, each with their own secrets and threats.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/b41b1a8c0ce8ce0121739a708850ece3.poster.avif?t=1747824839\" width=800 h