ong> Your shift ends at 6 a.m. if you make it that long.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/ad450579036f3ded72e9e876e876906d.poster.avif?t=1747824839\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/ad450579036f3ded72e9e876e876906d.webm?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/ad450579036f3ded72e9e876e876906d.mp4?t=1747824839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to confront what lurks in the shadows? Or will you be another <strong>[REDACTED]</strong> entry in Obscura\u2019s archives?</p>",
